 long runtime sessions, it handles repetitive gameplay loops with precision timing and minimal performance impact.\n\nFeatures are grouped for clarity and control:\n\nCore Automation\n\nAuto Fish Engine: Intelligent fishing loop with timing detection for consistent catches.\n\nSmart Reel System: Automatically reacts to bite events for optimized success rate.\n\nAuto Sell / Deposit: Moves fish to inventory or sells instantly to maintain farming flow.\n\nIdle Loop Handler: Keeps automation running safely during long AFK sessions.\n\nSession Stabilizer: Prevents desync and loop break during extended runtime.\n\nResource & Progression\n\nAuto Farm Currency: Continuous money generation through optimized catch cycles.\n\nAuto Upgrade Tools: Applies upgrades when requirements are met.\n\nAuto Equip Best Rod: Detects and switches to highest efficiency gear.\n\nInventory Manager: Prevents overflow and handles item sorting.\n\nMovement & Utility\n\nTeleport Nodes: Fast travel to fishing zones, shop, vendor, and safe areas.\n\nSpeed Control: Adjustable movement modifier for faster farming routes.\n\nNo Clip / Fly: Exploration mode for rapid repositioning.\n\nInstant Interact: Removes delays from NPC/shop interactions.\n\nVisual Enhancements\n\nFish ESP: Highlights catch zones and active fishing spots.\n\nItem ESP: Displays loot, vendors, and interactables through terrain.\n\nFullbright: Removes darkness/fog for clear visibility.\n\nZone Scanner: Reveals optimal fishing areas.\n\nStability & Protection\n\nAnti-AFK: Prevents inactivity kick.\n\nLow Resource Mode: Optimized for weak executors/devices.\n\nServer Sync Protection: Reduces script break during lag spikes.\n\nClean GUI: Lightweight interface with toggles and sliders.\n\nFish It Script is engineered for grinders who want predictable automation, stable execution, and maximum efficiency without babysitting the script.\n\nRun it. Farm passively. Let the framework do the work.","tags":[],"discord":"https://discord.gg/echostudios","keyLink":"","owner":{"_id":"6963c17f700628459246caf7","username":"Scapeshub","verified":false,"profilePicture":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/6769e6736d8853f13ba053664d5543f7f9fcddf3a5c9294c1cb43bef7d025ca6.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/photo/6963c17f700628459246caf7-1776017273810.jpg"},"lvl":6,"status":"offline","id":"6963c17f700628459246caf7","topMilestone":{"key":"creator.executions","tier":10000},"profile":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/6769e6736d8853f13ba053664d5543f7f9fcddf3a5c9294c1cb43bef7d025ca6.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/photo/6963c17f700628459246caf7-1776017273810.jpg"}},"reviewed":null,"liked":false,"disliked":false,"cstatus":{"verdict":"none","pct":null,"conf":0,"n":{"w":0,"b":0,"p":0,"d":0,"k":0},"total":0,"detected":false,"key":false,"recent":0,"at":"2026-10-20T02:44:26.907Z","last":"","win":14,"math":3},"isHub":false,"supportedGames":[],"changelog":[{"_id":"698cac7875af53480cd19cf4","editBy":{"_id":"6963c17f700628459246caf7","username":"Scapeshub","status":"offline","id":"6963c17f700628459246caf7"},"message":"Create script","createdAt":"2026-02-11T16:21:12.584Z"}],"comments":[{"_id":"698cc04510146ba1eebf7dd9","commentBy":{"_id":"6930737bf0170c0a5193fd1c","username":"Pearl_scripts","verified":false,"role":"user","profilePicture":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/f042566fc2508acab27b1a613084ce90de02704eaefa8a1360b85369c162a75a.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/photo/6930737bf0170c0a5193fd1c-1782038472796.jpg"},"lastActive":"2026-10-15T07:52:43.150Z","createdAt":"2025-12-03T17:29:31.838Z","lvl":11,"status":"offline","id":"6930737bf0170c0a5193fd1c","topMilestone":{"key":"creator.chart_topper","tier":1},"profile":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/f042566fc2508acab27b1a613084ce90de02704eaefa8a1360b85369c162a75a.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/photo/6930737bf0170c0a5193fd1c-1782038472796.jpg"}},"text":"Great script","edited":false,"likeCount":1,"dislikeCount":0,"createdAt":"2026-02-1